{"chars": "Higher still, the land flattened out into a wide, wet valley. Little streams wound through it, bright with snowmelt, and the ground was covered in round, shiny green cushions that squished underfoot. All around the edge of the valley, alpacas were grazing: brown ones and white ones and black ones and spotted ones, with fluffy topknots and soft, curious eyes. A few tall llamas stood among them like watchful aunties.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.925, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.438, 1.85, 1.85, 1.85, 1.85, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.25, 2.25, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.775, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.85, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.275, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.525, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.112, 6.975, 7.075, 7.075, 7.075, 7.075, 7.188, 7.188, 7.188, 7.188, 7.275, 7.275, 7.275, 7.275, 7.275, 7.275, 7.275, 7.662, 7.662, 7.662, 7.662, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 8.175, 8.175, 8.175, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.775, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 10.075, 10.075, 10.075, 10.075, 10.075, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 10.725, 11.675, 11.812, 11.812, 11.812, 11.812, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.025, 12.312, 12.312, 12.312, 12.312, 12.425, 12.425, 12.425, 12.425, 12.425, 12.637, 12.637, 12.63